<title>SWEDEN: TABLE - ASSA ABLOY H1 PROFIT UP 51 PCT.</title>
<headline>TABLE - ASSA ABLOY H1 PROFIT UP 51 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish lock maker Assa Abloy reported its earnings for the six months ending June 30, 1997 on Thursday.</p>
<p>					(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				225 vs   149</p>
<p> Sales					 3,035 vs 2,316</p>
<p> Earnings per share (SKR)		 2.38 vs 1.76</p>
<p> Costs of goods sold		     1,960 vs 1,490</p>
<p> Administrative costs			737 vs   602</p>
<p> Depreciation				   40 vs    23</p>
<p> Operating profit			    299 vs   201</p>
<p> Net financial items	   CHARGE     77 vs    56 CHARGE</p>
<p> Associate interests			   4 vs     4</p>
<p> Tax						68 vs    43</p>
<p> Net profit				    158 vs   106</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-7001017</p>
</text>
